# The Zeruhn Report (Bastok 1-1): Naji's 710 with the report already seen. A level 10 Warrior of Bastok with 1-1
# current and the Zeruhn Report (GMs; Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out), in Metalworks; the report seen (a GM's
# seeKeyItem): Naji's 710 (0); finished: completed, the report deleted.
lists Metalworks/Naji/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/710
char zone=Metalworks pos=64,-14,-4 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport current
keyitem ZeruhnReport
login
seekeyitem ZeruhnReport                 # a GM: seen
trigger Naji                            # the report, seen: 710 (0)
finish                                  # completed; the report deleted
